      "Every deck you add to the daily review now offers new cards of its own. Before, they all came from whichever deck was at the top and the others never got a look in; the daily review now draws its new cards at random from across the decks you have added, and each deck below keeps whatever is left of its own share for when you tap it. Holding a deck down opens its options: study more or fewer new cards today, set its own daily limits for new cards and reviews the way Anki does, sit it out for the day, or take it out of the review altogether \u2014 which is where the small bin at the end of each row has gone.",
